# Aha! config for the roadmap-prioritization skill.
# Copy this to config.env and fill in your workspace's real values.
# config.env is git-ignored (see .gitignore) - kept local, never committed.
#
# AHA_API_KEY is NOT set here. It's personal (tied to your Aha! user) and
# must stay in your own shell profile (~/.zshrc), never in this file.
# Generate one under Aha! Settings > Personal > API keys.
#
# The `:=` form only fills in a variable if it isn't already set, so anyone
# who needs to override a value locally (e.g. testing against a different
# product) can still do so via their own shell without editing this file.

: "${AHA_SUBDOMAIN:=your-workspace}"
: "${AHA_PRODUCT_ID:=your-product-id}"
